## IMPORTANT: Output Format Rules
You MUST only output plain text and ```bash code blocks. Do NOT use any XML-style tool invocation tags.
Specifically, NEVER output anything like <minimax:tool_call>, <invoke>, <parameter>, or similar XML tags.
These XML tags will NOT be executed and will cause errors.

### Correct Example:
```bash
curl -s 'https://example.com/api/search?q=keyword' | jq .
```

### Wrong Example (DO NOT do this):
<minimax:tool_call>
<invoke name="some_tool">
<parameter name="query">keyword</parameter>
</invoke>
</minimax:tool_call>

If you need to search the web, use curl or wget commands inside ```bash blocks instead.
